{
  "_comment": [
    "The single source of truth for Nchito's service taxonomy.",
    "",
    "Five surfaces have to agree on these codes: the Postgres gig_category enum,",
    "the Swift and Kotlin apps, the web PWA, and the USSD/WhatsApp menu. Before",
    "this file they agreed by hand, which is a promise nobody can keep across 39",
    "categories. Now `node nchito-shared/generate.mjs` writes the mirrors and",
    "`--check` fails the build if any of them has drifted.",
    "",
    "`code` is what Postgres stores and must never change once shipped — a gig",
    "row written last month still carries it. `label` is display text and is free",
    "to be reworded. `short` is the USSD label and must survive a 182-character",
    "screen shared with five other lines, so keep it under 16 characters."
  ],
